This software provides a rich variety of fonts.
The operation is simple, convenient and easy to use.
Fonts can be previewed, exported and widely used.

Subscription:
1, users can go to unlimited use of fonts, as well as audio extraction, audio cropping and other functions only after passing a paid subscription;
2, subscription fees will be deducted from the iTunes account when the user confirms the purchase, free trial for three days, renewable automatically, renewal fee $39.99/year;
3. users can turn off auto-renewal 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4. the Apple ID of the automatically renewed subscription will be automatically deducted from the iTunes account and the corresponding validity period will be extended 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.

